    "description": "You've got the desire to take a different parenting path, you just haven't found the right roadmap. Until now.\r\n\r\nThe Reconnected is an online course + community hub for individuals who are seeking a more modern, more intuitive, more value-aligned approach to parenting.\r\n\r\nYou're here because you're looking for an approach that:\r\n\r\n+ Helps you regulate more effectively as a whole family and experience more of the Ventral Vagal state together.\r\n\r\n+ Focuses on what you do as a parent starting now, whilst holding space for the experiences from your past that need neurological releasing and rewiring.\r\n\r\n+ One that goes beyond \u201cconscious parenting\u201d and isn\u2019t based in theory or talking, but in experiential, practical strategies and integrated practices.\r\n\r\nIn this app, Reconnected Community Members can access our free live events and our paid online courses and webinars, all in one place.\r\n\r\nJoin us in The Reconnected to:\r\n\r\n+ Connect with thousands of parents around the world who, like you, are partaking in the new paradigm of parenting. Never feel alone again, within this fast-growing community you'll be accepted for being the perfectly, imperfect parent that you are.\r\n\r\n+ Get expert guidance from co-founders Emma and Eleanor, as well as our tremendous team of qualified community coaches. Feel safe and held by experienced professionals, whilst you work through your personal process.\r\n\r\n+ Learn the unique blend of science and spirituality that has rippled out into the global movement that is The Reconnected.\r\n\r\nAbout Us:\r\n\r\n+ Eleanor Mann\r\n\r\nEleanor is registered counsellor, holding a BA of Social Science (Counselling), a BA of Psychology (Hons), a Diploma in Breathwork, and a Grad Diploma in Child Centered Play Therapy. Eleanor is a co-founder of The Reconnected and brings to the community a decade of working with parents as a counsellor, Breathworker and play therapist, and over 15 years of personal practice in Breathwork and personal development.\r\n\r\n+ Emma Alta\r\n\r\nEmma has been known as New Earth Mama for many years, a successful self published author with Mastery in Rebirthing Breathwork, Kundalini Yoga Teacher, Certified Advanced Theta Healing & Mind Body Intuitive, seeing thousands of clients with powerful testimonials. In her past she has been professional ballerina, and top model working for vogue, harpers bazaar and walking in London, Milan, Paris and Sydney Fashion week shows. Now, she is walking the path of conscious living with her young family on the east coast of Australia.\r\n\r\nIf you are looking for a parenting community and are wanting to know how to be the regulated, present, authentic parent you want to be...then we would love to have you! This online space is free for you to join with the option to opt into paid courses if you choose to dive deeper.",
